//! compose-rs's foundation, as Compose's `androidx.compose.foundation`: the layouts (`Box`,
//! `Column`, `Row`, `Spacer`, in `layout`), `BasicText`, `BasicTextField` and shapes. The
//! foundation modifiers (`clickable`, `toggleable`, `background`, `border`, …) are methods of
//! `Modifier`, re-exported here (docs/06-ui.md).

#![forbid(unsafe_code)]
// Every type reachable from the public API can be named (D260): a type in a private
// module that a public signature uses must be re-exported.
#![deny(unnameable_types)]
#![allow(non_snake_case)]

// Code generated by `#[composable]` names the runtime `::compose`.
extern crate compose_runtime as compose;

